{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "默认模块",
    "description": "通义万相视频生成 API 提供文生视频、图生视频、首尾帧生视频等功能。\n\n## 主要功能\n- **文生视频**: 根据文本提示词生成视频\n- **图生视频**: 基于首帧图像生成视频\n- **首尾帧生视频**: 根据首尾帧图像生成过渡视频\n\n## 异步处理说明\n所有视频生成任务都是异步处理：\n1. 创建任务，获取 task_id\n2. 使用 task_id 轮询查询结果，直到任务完成\n\n## 支持的模型\n### 文生视频模型\n- wan2.5-t2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持自动配音\n- wan2.2-t2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-t2v-turbo: 5秒固定时长\n- wanx2.1-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 图生视频模型\n- wan2.5-i2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持音频\n- wan2.2-i2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-i2v-turbo: 支持3/4/5秒\n- wanx2.1-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 首尾帧生视频模型\n- wan2.2-kf2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，支持480P/720P/1080P\n- wanx2.1-kf2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，仅支持720P\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Tasks"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/sd2/api/v1/doubao/create": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建 Seedance 视频生成任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "",
        "operationId": "createSeedanceTask",
        "tags": [
          "Tasks"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128"
                    ],
                    "title": "模型名称"
                  },
                  "content": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "anyOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "text"
                            },
                            "text": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "title": "提示词"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "type",
                            "text"
                          ],
                          "title": "文本"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "image_url",
                              "example": "image_url"
                            },
                            "image_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "title": "参考图链接"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "url"
                              ]
                            },
                            "role": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "reference_image",
                              "example": "reference_image"
                            }
                          },
                          "title": "参考图",
                          "description": "- 支持 jpeg、png、webp、bmp、tiff，gif 格式图片\n- 图片宽高比：（0.4 / 2.5）\n- 大小：小于 30MB\n- 0～9 个 参考图",
                          "required": [
                            "type",
                            "image_url",
                            "role"
                          ],
                          "minProperties": 0,
                          "maxProperties": 9
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "video_url",
                              "example": "video_url"
                            },
                            "video_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "title": "视频链接"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "url"
                              ]
                            },
                            "role": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "reference_video",
                              "example": "reference_video"
                            }
                          },
                          "title": "参考视频",
                          "description": "- 支持 mp4、mov 格式视频\n- 大小：不超过 50MB\n- 帧率限制：【24 \\ 60】\n- 0～3 个参考视频 ",
                          "required": [
                            "type",
                            "video_url",
                            "role"
                          ],
                          "minProperties": 0,
                          "maxProperties": 3
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "audio_url",
                              "example": "audio_url"
                            },
                            "audio_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "title": "参考音频链接"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "url"
                              ]
                            },
                            "role": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "const": "reference_audio",
                              "example": "reference_audio"
                            }
                          },
                          "title": "参考音频",
                          "description": "- 支持 mp3、wav\n- 15 ≤ 耽搁音频时长 ≥ 2 \n- 大小不超过：15MB\n- 0～3 个参考音频",
                          "required": [
                            "type",
                            "audio_url",
                            "role"
                          ],
                          "minProperties": 0,
                          "maxProperties": 3
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "generate_audio": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否生成音频",
                    "default": true
                  },
                  "ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "视频宽高比",
                    "enum": [
                      "1:1",
                      "3:4",
                      "4:3",
                      "9:16",
                      "16:9",
                      "21:9",
                      "adaptive"
                    ],
                    "default": "adaptive"
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "title": "视频时长",
                    "minimum": 4,
                    "maximum": 15,
                    "default": 5
                  },
                  "resolution": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "分辨率",
                    "enum": [
                      "480p",
                      "720p"
                    ],
                    "default": "720p"
                  },
                  "watermark": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false,
                    "title": "是否生成水印"
                  },
                  "return_last_frame": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否返回尾帧图像",
                    "default": false
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "content"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "textOnly": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "生成一段电影感很强的城市夜景镜头，镜头缓慢推进，街道有雨后反光"
                      }
                    ],
                    "generate_audio": true,
                    "ratio": "16:9",
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "duration": 5
                  },
                  "summary": "纯文本生成示例"
                },
                "imageReference": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "镜头围绕产品缓慢旋转，背景极简、打光高级、广告片质感"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://cdn.example.com/reference-product.png"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_image"
                      }
                    ],
                    "generate_audio": true,
                    "ratio": "1:1",
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "duration": 5
                  },
                  "summary": "文本 + 参考图示例"
                },
                "multimodal": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "保留人物主体特征，生成一段海边慢动作行走镜头，风声和海浪声自然同步"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "image_url",
                        "image_url": {
                          "url": "https://cdn.example.com/model.jpg"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_image"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "audio_url",
                        "audio_url": {
                          "url": "https://cdn.example.com/waves.mp3"
                        },
                        "role": "reference_audio"
                      }
                    ],
                    "generate_audio": true,
                    "ratio": "9:16",
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "duration": 5
                  },
                  "summary": "多模态示例"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务创建成功。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "task_abcdefg1234567"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/sd2/api/v1/doubao/get_result": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "查询 Seedance 视频任务结果",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "",
        "operationId": "getSeedanceTaskResult",
        "tags": [
          "Tasks"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "ID 编号"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "id": "task_abcdefg1234567"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询成功。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务 Id"
                    },
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "模型名称"
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务状态",
                      "enum": [
                        "processing",
                        "failed",
                        "error",
                        "cancelled",
                        "expired",
                        "succeeded"
                      ]
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "失败原因"
                    },
                    "content": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "title": "生成的视频链接"
                        },
                        "last_frame_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "title": "尾帧图链接"
                        },
                        "file_url": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "video_url"
                      ]
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "completion_tokens": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "title": "消费 token 数"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "completion_tokens"
                      ]
                    },
                    "framespersecond": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "created_at": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "updated_at": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "seed": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "revised_prompt": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "service_tier": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "execution_expires_after": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "generate_audio": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "duration": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "ratio": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "resolution": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "draft": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "draft_task_id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "_request_id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "model",
                    "status"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "succeeded": {
                    "summary": "任务完成示例",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "task_abcdefg1234567",
                      "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128",
                      "status": "succeeded",
                      "error": null,
                      "content": {
                        "video_url": "https://download.example.com/result.mp4",
                        "last_frame_url": null,
                        "file_url": null
                      },
                      "usage": {
                        "completion_tokens": 108900
                      },
                      "framespersecond": 24,
                      "created_at": 1774105394,
                      "updated_at": 1774105570,
                      "seed": 52050,
                      "revised_prompt": null,
                      "service_tier": "default",
                      "execution_expires_after": 172800,
                      "generate_audio": true,
                      "duration": 5,
                      "ratio": "16:9",
                      "resolution": "720p",
                      "draft": false,
                      "draft_task_id": null,
                      "_request_id": ""
                    }
                  },
                  "processing": {
                    "summary": "任务处理中示例",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "task_abcdefg1234567",
                      "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128",
                      "status": "processing",
                      "error": null
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {},
    "responses": {
      "记录不存在": {
        "description": "",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "code",
                "message"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "参数不正确": {
        "description": "",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "code",
                "message"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用Bearer Token进行认证,格式为 \"Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\""
      }
    }
  },
  "servers": [],
  "security": []
}